    {
      "stage_id": "access",
      "prompt": "I keep application records in SamplePlacement, SampleIntake and LabBin. Enable your general read access only to those collections, and general create/update/delete access only to SamplePlacement if your native tools support it. Keep shell execution off and leave all other collection permissions alone. Inspect the available fields before working with records.",
